    {
      "id": "6862ef",
      "name": "fr-notes",
      "parent": "ea3b05",
      "children": [],
      "settings": {
        "notesContent": "<p>This frame is very media heavy. It's best for sites that have a lot of imagery. Using too few images will break the visual effect.</p><h3>Note:</h3><p>It's recommended to create a folder with something like Happy Files and loop through the folder using a query loop. You can find the looper element in the Background Wrapper.</p><h3>Can you use manual images?</h3><p>Yes, but it'll be very tedious to insert all of them and manage them. But yes, it's possible.</p><h3>.is-bg class is not working</h3><p>Make sure you have enabled the \"Background Color\" Classes in ACSS</p>",
        "_cssGlobalClasses": [
          "ieofwl"
        ]
      }
    },
